ences and manage if we can reach you with our own or third-party offers.\\\",\\\"marketing_consent_agreement_text\\\":\\\"I want exclusive news and special deals from Oddsportal and its trusted partners.\\\",\\\"marketing_emails_unsubscribe_success\\\":\\\"You have been successfully unsubscribed.\\\",\\\"or_lowercase\\\":\\\"or\\\",\\\"claim_now\\\":\\\"Claim Now\\\",\\\"form\\\":\\\"Form\\\",\\\"team_modal_title\\\":\\\"New Team Page on OddsPortal!\\\",\\\"team_modal_body\\\":\\\"We created new pages with betting insights, odds, results, and other details about a specific team. You can access it via Match detail, Standings page or Search.\\\",\\\"team_modal_button\\\":\\\"VISIT A TEAM PAGE\\\",\\\"team_modal_boldtext\\\":\\\"Check it out now!\\\",\\\"to_win_team_page\\\":\\\"to Win\\\",\\\"ai_match_predictions\\\":\\\"AI Match Predictions\\\",\\\"probability\\\":\\\"Probability\\\",\\\"probability_short\\\":\\\"Prob.\\\",\\\"all_bookies_label\\\":\\\"All Bookies\\\",\\\"classic_bookies_label\\\":\\\"Classic Bookies\\\",\\\"crypto_bookies_label\\\":\\\"Crypto Bookies\\\",\\\"btts_tooltip_text\\\":\\\"Percentage of matches where both teams scored (counting the last 6 games).\\\",\\\"over_2_5_tooltip_text\\\":\\\"Percentage of matches with over [goals] total goals from the last 6 games.\\\",\\\"new_username\\\":\\\"New Username\\\",\\\"bookie_offer_no_odds\\\":\\\"This bookmaker doesn’t offer odds for this match.\\\",\\\"hide_bookies_without_odds\\\":\\\"Hide bookmakers without odds\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_title\\\":\\\"Disfruta al máximo de CuotasAhora.com\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_text\\\":\\\"Para sacar el máximo partido de nuestro contenido, incluidas las cuotas, por favor, confirma tu edad.\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_primary_btn\\\":\\\"Soy mayor de 18 años\\\",\\\"es_age_modal_secondary_btn\\\":\\\"Soy menor de 18 años\\\",\\\"average_points_scored\\\":\\\"Av. Points Scored\\\",\\\"average_points_conceded\\\":\\\"Av. Points Conceded\\\",\\\"average_runs_scored\\\":\\\"Av. Run