/K00665Rc-KCp4zq5F.png?260917091420\\\",\\\"outcomeId\\\":485291,\\\"odds\\\":{\\\"141\\\":[25]},\\\"avgMax\\\":{\\\"avg\\\":{\\\"0\\\":25},\\\"max\\\":{\\\"0\\\":25}},\\\"history\\\":{\\\"back\\\":{\\\"485291\\\":{\\\"141\\\":[[23,null,1789291048],[15,null,1788722443],[16,null,1788628124],[13,null,1788211043],[14,null,1788111507],[10,null,1787606942],[8,null,1787517001],[7,null,1787434981],[6,null,1784796710],[6.5,null,1782410411]]}}},\\\"bookmakers\\\":{\\\"Betclic.fr\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Betclic.fr\\\",\\\"id\\\":141,\\\"odds\\\":\\\"$9f:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:item:odds:141\\\",\\\"status\\\":[1,0],\\\"bonus\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"statusMsg\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"active\\\":true,\\\"changeTime\\\":[1789328608],\\\"providerLogo\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"providersPageLink\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"providerAffLink\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"providersBonusLink\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"betslip\\\":[\\\"/bookmakers/betclic-fr/betslip/p/\\\"],\\\"showNameOnly\\\":false,\\\"newText\\\":\\\"\\\"}}},\\\"tournamentId\\\":113053,\\\"rowId\\\":485291,\\\"isLastRow\\\":true,\\\"predictionUkey\\\":\\\"O-113053_11\\\",\\\"communityPredData\\\":{\\\"total\\\":{\\\"O-113053_11\\\":5},\\\"count\\\":{\\\"O-485301\\\":1,\\\"O-485319\\\":3,\\\"O-485291\\\":1},\\\"group\\\":{\\\"O-485301\\\":\\\"O-113053_11\\\",\\\"O-485319\\\":\\\"O-113053_11\\\",\\\"O-485291\\\":\\\"O-113053_11\\\"}},\\\"userPredData\\\":[],\\\"predictionParentData\\\":{\\\"E\\\":[],\\\"O\\\":[113053]},\\\"oddsWatchInitial\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"theme\\\":\\\"light\\\"}]]}]]}]\\nab:T1089,\\u003cdiv class=\\\"cms\\\"\\u003e\\u003ch2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003eLiverpool Results, Fixtures, and Stats Explained\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eThis page is your ultimate guide for Liverpool betting odds, detailing their upcoming fixtures, recent form, and lots of other key stats.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eWe deliver the best Liverpool betting odds in each of their upcoming matches for several different markets, and support your betting decisions with recent form, head-to-heads, and closing odds to analyse bookmaker accuracy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eFeaturing in multiple competitions each season, you can find both Premier League and FA Cup betting odds for Liverpool throughout their campaign on OddsPortal today, as we compare bookmaker odds to supply you with the best value.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e[[ShowMore]]\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003eHow to Bet on Liverpool Matches\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eYou can bet on any of the Liverpool matches throughout the season and inform your betting decisions by analysing our recent form, head-to-head records, and more.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eAmong those recent results and H2H records, you can take a look at how\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href=\\\"/bookmakers/\\\"\\u003ebookmakers\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;priced those games and whether Liverpool overcome the odds, and how it translates to the current betting odds for their next games.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eYou can take a deep dive into looking at the 1X2 market and the odds of Liverpool wins, draws, and losses, whilst also checking both teams to score, over/under, handicap, and other markets too.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eAll of these options are available with a complete breakdown of the odds from our suggested bookmakers for every Liverpool fixture.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eYou can make your own\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href=\\\"/predictions/\\\"\\u003epredictions\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;on OddsPortal by adding selections from Liverpool odds to your coupon as a registered user and saving your selection.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eOur recommended bookmakers throughout our site are all trusted and licensed, and we directly compare them to bring you optimal value for every bet you place.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003eDomestic and International Competitions\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eBy finishing in the top positions, which are laid out on our standings page, Liverpool can also participate in the following season\\u0026rsquo;s continental competitions. This means there are even more betting opportunities involving Liverpool to be taken advantage of when they feature in other competitions outside of their main league.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eFurthermore, Liverpool also compete in the FA Cup every season, as they aim to secure a domestic trophy and add to their list of honours. This knockout competition sees teams from various divisions in the football pyramid battle for one trophy, starting with early rounds and progressing all the way to the final.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3 dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"\\u003eLiverpool FA Cup Odds\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eOn our platform, we offer you the latest Liverpool FA Cup odds through either their upcoming matches, or the outrights page. We offer the same betting markets for Liverpool FA Cup fixtures as we do for their upcoming games in the league, meaning you can take your pick from 1X2, both teams to score, over/under, handicap betting, or another option.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eDiscover whether Liverpool are one of the favourites to win the FA Cup in the odds for this season or who they are facing in the next round of fixtures.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"\\u003eOther Premier League Team Odds\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eLiverpool is just one of many that feature in the Premier League, and you can also discover the latest betting odds, form, league position, and plenty more through our \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/football/team/arsenal/hA1Zm19f/\\\"\\u003eArsenal\\u003c/a\\u003e odds, \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/football/team/manchester-city/Wtn9Stg0/\\\"\\u003eManchester City\\u003c/a\\u003e odds, \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.oddsportal.com/football/team/leeds/tUxUbLR2/\\\"\\u003eLeeds\\u003c/a\\u003e odds, and more.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\\u003eFor more betting opportunities, check all \\u003ca href=\\\"/football/england/premier-league/\\\"\\u003ePremier League\\u003c/a\\u003e odds here.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003ea0:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Laa\\\",null,{\\\"html\\\":\\\"$ab\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><div hidden id=\"S:55\"><span class=\"min-w-0 min-sx:text-base\">Iraola Andoni</span></div><script>$RS(\"S:55\",\"P:55\")</script><div hidden id=\"S:56\"><div class=\"team-standings-content mt-3 hidden\"><h2 class=\"mb-[10px] font-secondary text-[19px] font-semibold leading-7 text-black-main\">Premier League Standings</h2><style>.stats-note-container { display: none; }</style><div class=\"standings-box flex min-h-[80vh] flex-col\" aria-busy=\"true\" data-standings-ready=\"false\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none\"></div></div></div></div><script>$RS(\"S:56\",\"P:56\")</script><script>$RC(\"B:52\",\"S:52\")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"ac:I[108626,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1c903j7c2wxjq.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2d-m4e1_9rbte.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0qal4luc1-ona.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1cvyov0_zkqm5.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/336375_d-ridk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1petyrvfiuflx.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h9izan-bqvt1.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/ch